WEBVTT

00:07.487 --> 00:09.287
<b>Man, y'know...</b>

00:09.287 --> 00:12.477
<b>You did well hiring this 
large a mercenary group.</b>

00:12.477 --> 00:14.807
<b>Yes. I got lucky.</b>

00:14.807 --> 00:17.497
<b>Most of the mercenaries are 
currently in the north.</b>

00:17.907 --> 00:20.057
<b>The Northern Disturbance, huh?</b>

00:20.057 --> 00:20.707
<b>Yes.</b>

00:21.497 --> 00:23.177
<b><i>The Northern Disturbance.</i></b>

00:23.177 --> 00:27.257
<b><i>Barbarians suddenly appeared in the northern 
province of the Holy Kingdom of Qualia</i></b>

00:27.917 --> 00:29.767
<b><i>and raided the villages.</i></b>

00:29.767 --> 00:31.597
<b><i>It caused enormous damage.</i></b>

00:32.637 --> 00:36.317
<b><i>The saint and the army were sent 
to bring things under control,</i></b>

00:36.317 --> 00:39.187
<b><i>but the disturbance still shows 
no signs of settling down.</i></b>

00:40.397 --> 00:43.857
<b>Man, I've heard the north is in trouble.</b>

00:44.227 --> 00:46.197
<b>Don't talk like it doesn't concern you, Bargo.</b>

00:46.197 --> 00:50.787
<b>You say that, but it 
really isn't our problem.</b>

00:50.787 --> 00:53.647
<b>What, you guys don't plan on going on there?</b>

00:53.647 --> 00:55.917
<b>I heard you can earn a lot of money.</b>

00:55.917 --> 00:57.927
<b>Even if it pays well,</b>

00:57.927 --> 01:01.047
<b>after hearing there's a Witch 
up there, I'm staying away.</b>

01:01.397 --> 01:02.267
<b>A Witch?</b>

01:03.167 --> 01:05.707
<b>Well, who cares about the north.</b>

01:05.707 --> 01:09.197
<b>We're heading south, to the Accursed Lands.</b>

01:09.197 --> 01:10.807
<b>Who knows what we'll find there,</b>

01:10.807 --> 01:12.517
<b>so be on guard.</b>

01:14.087 --> 01:15.727
<b>I know that, buddy.</b>

03:00.497 --> 03:02.037
Life Doesn't Always Go Your Way

03:06.047 --> 03:08.457
<b>Bargo, what was that about a Witch?</b>

03:09.527 --> 03:13.407
<b>Oh, it's just a rumor. Hearsay.</b>

03:13.407 --> 03:18.677
<b>People are talking and saying that the 
commotion up north was caused by a Witch.</b>

03:18.977 --> 03:20.567
<b>Ridiculous.</b>

03:20.567 --> 03:23.317
<b>The saint was sent to the north as well.</b>

03:23.317 --> 03:25.517
<b>There's no way one person caused that.</b>

03:25.817 --> 03:28.877
<b>Yeah, I figure that's impossible too.</b>

03:28.877 --> 03:31.007
<b>Probably some heretics or something.</b>

03:29.987 --> 03:31.007
<b>Stop it!</b>

03:31.007 --> 03:32.757
<b>Enough with the depressing talk!</b>

03:32.757 --> 03:34.237
<b>S-Sorry.</b>

03:36.117 --> 03:37.057
<b>Refill!</b>

03:37.057 --> 03:37.827
<b>Coming!</b>

03:38.247 --> 03:40.657
<b>Haven't you had a bit too 
much to drink, buddy?</b>

03:40.947 --> 03:43.207
<b>Quit nitpicking, Bargo.</b>

03:43.207 --> 03:46.367
<b>God has told us: "After caring for 
the suffering of the populace</b>

03:46.367 --> 03:49.787
<b>in your own home and before your 
family, you should doff your robes."</b>

03:49.787 --> 03:50.377
<b>In other words!</b>

03:50.997 --> 03:54.327
<b>When work is over, it's okay 
to cut loose and relax!</b>

03:54.327 --> 03:58.847
<b>That's Article 3, Section 4, Clause 3 
of the Holy God Arlos's doctrine, right?</b>

03:59.207 --> 04:04.527
<b>That clause preaches that we're temporarily 
freed from our sacred duties around our families.</b>

04:04.527 --> 04:07.277
<b>It's not supposed to grant 
permission for drinking.</b>

04:08.227 --> 04:11.007
<b>Hmm? A difference in interpretation.</b>

04:11.007 --> 04:14.107
<b>Do we need to engage in 
religious debate, Lonius?</b>

04:14.597 --> 04:16.237
<b>I've brought your refill!</b>

04:17.067 --> 04:18.237
<b>I've waited for this!</b>

04:21.727 --> 04:26.417
<b>Still, guys, we have two Paladins going 
out of their way to investigate something.</b>

04:26.417 --> 04:29.417
<b>Something in the Accursed Lands 
of the Dark Continent, no less.</b>

04:29.417 --> 04:31.377
<b>What on earth could be that important?</b>

04:31.827 --> 04:36.247
<b>It's not something involving 
a Witch like up north, is it?</b>

04:36.247 --> 04:38.507
<b>If it is, then we're...</b>

04:38.507 --> 04:40.377
<b>It's not that.</b>

04:40.377 --> 04:41.937
<b>Don't worry.</b>

04:41.937 --> 04:44.017
<b>We do have an idea of what it is.</b>

04:45.637 --> 04:48.087
<b>Yeah? What is it?</b>

04:48.087 --> 04:51.437
<b>Well, that's where the Dark Elves ran off to.</b>

04:51.437 --> 04:56.107
<b>The brass are probably just 
worried about them causing trouble.</b>

04:56.107 --> 04:57.497
<b>I see!</b>

04:57.497 --> 04:59.857
<b>You're right that we can't 
just leave them alone.</b>

04:59.857 --> 05:03.367
<b>They're talented in curses and 
assassinations, after all.</b>

05:03.767 --> 05:07.107
<b>If they were to gain power in hiding,</b>

05:07.107 --> 05:08.877
<b>they'd eventually turn their blades on us!</b>

05:08.877 --> 05:11.167
<b>Don't tense up, Lonius.</b>

05:11.167 --> 05:13.447
<b>We're just investigating this time.</b>

05:13.447 --> 05:15.287
<b>We can just run 
if it gets dangerous.</b>

05:15.287 --> 05:17.337
<b>Just run away.</b>

05:17.337 --> 05:21.507
<b>Oh! It's a relief for us 
to hear that's your plan.</b>

05:21.837 --> 05:27.217
<b>Sir Verdel, are you sure that's the attitude 
we should have as God's vanguards?</b>

05:27.217 --> 05:30.487
<b>If we find evil in there, then shouldn't
 we risk our lives to exterminate it?</b>

05:30.487 --> 05:31.477
<b>Lonius!</b>

05:31.817 --> 05:33.427
<b>Don't be too hungry for glory.</b>

05:33.427 --> 05:36.687
<b>There will come a time when that's 
necessary for us as Paladins.</b>

05:36.687 --> 05:39.567
<b>But that's not something you 
should decide so easily.</b>

05:39.567 --> 05:40.747
<b>But...</b>

05:40.747 --> 05:42.527
<b>You have a family, don't you?</b>

05:43.977 --> 05:46.267
<b>It's the same for me and these guys.</b>

05:46.267 --> 05:49.747
<b>We have good reasons not to die. So...</b>

05:52.077 --> 05:53.517
<b>Enough, enough!</b>

05:53.517 --> 05:56.917
<b>Have I become a self-important old man, 
drinking booze and lecturing others?!</b>

05:56.917 --> 05:58.377
<b>Old man?</b>

05:59.067 --> 06:00.217
<b>You guys!</b>

06:00.217 --> 06:02.117
<b>We're hitting the Dark Continent tomorrow!</b>

06:02.117 --> 06:03.947
<b>So go on and drink up now!</b>

06:03.947 --> 06:06.847
<b>Yeah!</b>

06:10.847 --> 06:13.187
<b>May the Holy God Arlos' 
protection be with them.</b>

06:22.127 --> 06:24.577
<b>Umm, is something about to happen?</b>

06:24.577 --> 06:25.707
<b>I don't know.</b>

06:25.707 --> 06:28.187
<b>But our king has gathered us here.</b>

06:28.187 --> 06:29.737
<b>I'm sure it's important to the nation.</b>

06:29.737 --> 06:32.127
<b>Be quiet. It's starting.</b>

07:10.077 --> 07:11.907
<b>The Flesh Tree's fruit...</b>

07:11.907 --> 07:13.277
<b>Became a Long-legged Bug?!</b>

07:13.277 --> 07:17.457
<b>My king, are you truly 
able to create new life?</b>

07:20.777 --> 07:21.817
<b>Oh my!</b>

07:21.817 --> 07:23.177
<b>Whoa!</b>

07:23.647 --> 07:25.017
<b>Did you see that?</b>

07:25.017 --> 07:28.637
<b>This is the power of our 
king, King Ira Takuto.</b>

07:29.247 --> 07:33.367
<b>Our king still has much 
more power than this too.</b>

07:33.367 --> 07:36.107
<b>Your dedication and your happiness</b>

07:36.107 --> 07:38.857
<b>will grant our king even more powers!</b>

07:39.427 --> 07:40.087
<b>Everyone!</b>

07:40.087 --> 07:43.747
<b>Show our king even more 
devotion for his sake!</b>

07:43.747 --> 07:44.817
<b>Do you understand?!</b>

07:44.817 --> 07:48.287
<b>Yeah!</b>

07:48.287 --> 07:53.117
New unit produced through normal production.

07:48.287 --> 07:53.117
New unit! Long-legged Bug

07:56.097 --> 07:58.087
<b>I'm glad it went well.</b>

07:58.087 --> 08:00.907
<b>Good work out there, King Takuto.</b>

08:00.907 --> 08:04.427
<b>I'm delighted that we were 
able to use normal production.</b>

08:04.707 --> 08:07.097
<b>Yeah. There's that too,</b>

08:07.097 --> 08:11.327
<b>but I'm relieved they backed down when 
I smiled to brush off their question.</b>

08:11.327 --> 08:12.657
<b>Although...</b>

08:12.657 --> 08:14.647
<b>I wonder what's going on with that too.</b>

08:14.647 --> 08:18.767
<b>Yes. I didn't think it'd be as simple as 
gathering the resources, pouring mana into them,</b>

08:18.767 --> 08:20.397
<b>and then "There, all done."</b>

08:21.887 --> 08:25.347
<b>Well, thinking about things we 
don't understand won't do any good.</b>

08:25.347 --> 08:27.067
<b>More importantly, King Takuto!</b>

08:27.067 --> 08:27.617
<b>Yeah?</b>

08:28.147 --> 08:29.767
<b>With this latest ritual,</b>

08:29.767 --> 08:32.717
<b>we were able to confirm that we 
can we safely produce new units.</b>

08:32.717 --> 08:34.407
<b>That means next time we can...</b>

08:34.407 --> 08:35.497
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:35.497 --> 08:37.247
<b>We'll conduct a Hero Summoning.</b>

08:37.247 --> 08:38.987
<b>I knew it!</b>

08:38.987 --> 08:41.977
<b>Even though we need to build 
up a stockpile of mana for now,</b>

08:41.977 --> 08:44.237
<b>we finally have a path forward.</b>

08:44.237 --> 08:46.077
<b>With two Heroes on our side,</b>

08:46.077 --> 08:49.177
<b>we can be assured of our fighting forces.</b>

08:49.497 --> 08:52.137
<b>So who do you plan to summon first?</b>

08:52.137 --> 08:54.907
<b>Isla, the Queen of Bugs.</b>

08:54.907 --> 08:56.687
<b>I'm thinking of going with her.</b>

08:56.687 --> 08:58.347
<b>Isla, then?!</b>

08:58.347 --> 09:00.647
<b>She's fairly overpowered too, isn't she?!</b>

09:00.647 --> 09:01.857
<b>Yeah!</b>

09:02.447 --> 09:08.197
<b>Isla, the Queen of Bugs, is one of Mynoghra's 
proud insectoid Heroes.</b>

09:08.197 --> 09:11.927
<b>She has the ability to 
empower all Insect units.</b>

09:11.927 --> 09:13.147
<b>With that,</b>

09:13.147 --> 09:16.437
<b>the Long-legged Bugs will 
become top-notch fighters.</b>

09:16.437 --> 09:17.537
<b>Moreover,</b>

09:17.537 --> 09:21.207
<b>she also has the ability 
to produce Larva units</b>

09:21.207 --> 09:22.917
<b>and create our workforce.</b>

09:23.387 --> 09:28.247
<b>Isla boasts great performance in 
both war and domestic affairs.</b>

09:28.247 --> 09:31.347
<b>She's the Hero we need the most right now.</b>

09:32.387 --> 09:34.397
<b>That's impressive, King Takuto.</b>

09:34.397 --> 09:37.397
<b>Getting Isla early in the game to 
give birth, increase the workforce,</b>

09:37.397 --> 09:39.747
<b>and grow more powerful 
is a standard strategy.</b>

09:39.747 --> 09:42.397
<b>When faced with many unknown elements,</b>

09:42.397 --> 09:45.987
<b>that's all the more reason to 
adopt the most reliable plan.</b>

09:45.987 --> 09:47.847
<b>Exactly.</b>

09:47.847 --> 09:51.467
<b>Well, that and all the others 
have horrible personalities.</b>

09:51.467 --> 09:54.197
<b>That meant Isla was the only choice we had.</b>

09:56.277 --> 09:57.667
<b>Now that you mention it,</b>

09:57.667 --> 09:59.897
<b>one loves world conquest,</b>

09:59.897 --> 10:02.607
<b>another loves throwing 
the world into chaos...</b>

10:02.607 --> 10:05.087
<b>All our Heroes are problematic...</b>

10:05.627 --> 10:07.017
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:07.017 --> 10:08.977
<b>We want to focus on domestic affairs,</b>

10:08.977 --> 10:12.417
<b>so the idea of summoning them is a bit... y'know?</b>

10:14.887 --> 10:17.037
<b>We can't go without their abilities,</b>

10:17.037 --> 10:18.867
<b>and I'd personally love to meet them too,</b>

10:18.867 --> 10:21.487
<b>so I plan to summon them eventually.</b>

10:21.487 --> 10:25.707
<b>I just hope they don't cause issues.</b>

10:26.907 --> 10:29.547
<b>I want to live in peace, Atou.</b>

10:29.547 --> 10:31.777
<b>Yes, my king.</b>

10:46.407 --> 10:48.087
<b>It's a Hill Giant!</b>

10:48.547 --> 10:51.407
<b>Foul things attacking in broad daylight!</b>

10:51.407 --> 10:54.177
<b>I suppose I should expect 
that from the Dark Continent.</b>

10:54.177 --> 10:57.487
<b>Hey guys, sorry to ask, but 
could you give us some help?</b>

10:57.487 --> 10:59.207
<b>Of course. You men draw your bows—</b>

10:59.207 --> 11:00.497
<b>No, I'll do it.</b>

11:00.497 --> 11:01.257
<b>Huh?!</b>

11:01.257 --> 11:02.057
<b>Are you sure?</b>

11:02.347 --> 11:06.487
<b>Yeah. We don't have time to 
waste getting delayed here.</b>

11:16.647 --> 11:18.817
<b>None of you guys do anything.</b>

11:18.817 --> 11:21.707
<b>It'll be a pain if his 
attention gets distracted.</b>

11:33.317 --> 11:36.987
<b>O God! Grant me the power 
to strike down evil!</b>

11:37.947 --> 11:39.847
<b>A holy sword art?</b>

11:39.847 --> 11:40.857
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:40.857 --> 11:44.657
<b>It's Qualia's secret technique of incorporating
prayers into the motions of our sword</b>

11:44.657 --> 11:45.937
<b>in order to gain divine might.</b>

11:46.967 --> 11:47.897
<b>It's starting!</b>

11:53.627 --> 11:54.317
<b>Look out!</b>

11:58.157 --> 11:59.127
<b>Wha?!</b>

12:00.867 --> 12:01.827
<b>Wha?!</b>

12:01.827 --> 12:05.607
<b>Paladins granted divine might have 
their physical abilities enhanced,</b>

12:05.607 --> 12:08.817
<b>and the power to eradicate 
evil fills their bodies.</b>

12:08.817 --> 12:11.837
<b>For a High Paladin, that power is...</b>

12:20.597 --> 12:22.857
<b>equivalent to that of a Lesser Dragon.</b>

12:22.857 --> 12:25.437
<b>A hill giant won't even stand a chance.</b>

12:27.037 --> 12:28.587
<b>Yeah!</b>

12:33.177 --> 12:35.287
<b>That was impressive, Sir Verdel.</b>

12:35.287 --> 12:35.817
<b>Hmm?</b>

12:36.387 --> 12:38.107
<b>With power like that,</b>

12:38.107 --> 12:41.157
<b>we should be able to complete 
our mission without any issues.</b>

12:44.807 --> 12:46.387
<b>I'm not so sure.</b>

12:57.467 --> 12:58.787
<b>King Takuto...</b>

12:59.927 --> 13:02.527
<b>Why don't you eat something 
that's finer quality?</b>

13:02.527 --> 13:03.267
<b>Huh?</b>

13:03.267 --> 13:04.517
<b>I can't eat it?</b>

13:04.517 --> 13:06.277
<b>You're welcome to eat it...</b>

13:06.277 --> 13:09.637
<b>but I think you should be 
eating healthier meals.</b>

13:09.637 --> 13:11.727
<b>I'm sick of doing that.</b>

13:13.757 --> 13:15.387
<b>When I was hospitalized,</b>

13:15.387 --> 13:17.537
<b>I ate lots of that stuff.</b>

13:17.537 --> 13:20.107
<b>On that note, though,</b>

13:20.107 --> 13:21.657
<b>I'm more worried about you.</b>

13:21.657 --> 13:24.047
<b>Worried? Why is that?</b>

13:24.047 --> 13:25.407
<b>Why?</b>

13:26.127 --> 13:27.867
<b>Because you're just eating salads.</b>

13:27.867 --> 13:31.027
<b>That suits my tastes better.</b>

13:31.027 --> 13:34.347
<b>You're far too healthy 
for your evil alignment.</b>

13:34.347 --> 13:35.437
<b>Anyway,</b>

13:35.437 --> 13:37.507
<b>this is becoming incredible, isn't it?</b>

13:37.507 --> 13:40.147
<b>The Materials for constructing 
the Palace, right?</b>

13:40.147 --> 13:42.647
<b>The Dark Elves are certainly going all out.</b>

13:42.647 --> 13:44.427
<b>Oh! That reminds me.</b>

13:44.427 --> 13:46.057
<b>What's the matter?</b>

13:46.057 --> 13:49.147
<b>Once we're done eating, could you 
summon Moltar and the others?</b>

13:49.147 --> 13:50.907
<b>As you wish.</b>

13:50.907 --> 13:52.687
<b>Though what did you wish to discuss?</b>

13:53.047 --> 13:54.727
<b>Thanks to the Long-legged Bugs,</b>

13:54.727 --> 13:58.157
<b>I can see the area around the forest as well.</b>

13:58.157 --> 14:00.657
<b>I figured I'd consult with 
them on how to handle it.</b>

14:00.967 --> 14:04.737
<b>We need to handle the area around the forest?</b>

14:05.447 --> 14:08.197
<b>You're referring to the nearby city, then?</b>

14:08.197 --> 14:09.077
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:09.077 --> 14:12.187
<b>That town's not part of... Qualia, was it?</b>

14:12.187 --> 14:14.747
<b>It's not part of that good nation.</b>

14:14.747 --> 14:17.927
<b>Well, Qualia is much further to the north.</b>

14:17.927 --> 14:22.537
<b>This town would be of a different, 
neutral nation in the east.</b>

14:22.537 --> 14:25.797
<b>We certainly should decide 
on how to handle this.</b>

14:25.797 --> 14:29.917
<b>They're likely to be the first 
to discover our existence,</b>

14:29.917 --> 14:31.407
<b>since they're closest.</b>

14:31.407 --> 14:32.627
<b>Right?</b>

14:32.627 --> 14:35.317
<b>I'm glad they're a neutral nation.</b>

14:35.317 --> 14:38.027
<b>If they were good, there would 
be no chance of negotiating.</b>

14:38.027 --> 14:39.087
<b>Yes.</b>

14:39.087 --> 14:42.447
<b>Anyone else coming here would mean trouble.</b>

14:42.447 --> 14:45.187
<b>Since it would mean they came with a purpose.</b>

14:45.187 --> 14:47.607
<b>You're such a worrywart, Atou.</b>

14:48.197 --> 14:51.997
<b>There's no sign that anyone's 
aware of our existence,</b>

14:51.997 --> 14:53.287
<b>so it'll be fine.</b>

14:53.287 --> 14:55.207
<b>Oh, silly King Takuto!</b>

14:55.207 --> 14:59.027
<b>Saying such things will trigger 
an event flag, you know?</b>

14:59.027 --> 15:01.927
<b>No way. It won't trigger—</b>

15:03.787 --> 15:05.597
<b>Wh-What's happened?</b>

15:05.597 --> 15:07.827
<b>Looks like someone really did come here.</b>

15:09.827 --> 15:12.957
<b>There's an armed band approaching the forest.</b>

15:12.957 --> 15:13.687
<b>Atou.</b>

15:13.687 --> 15:14.187
<b>Yes!</b>

15:14.497 --> 15:16.337
<b>I want to avoid standing out for now.</b>

15:16.337 --> 15:18.577
<b>Go turn them away as peacefully as possible.</b>

15:18.577 --> 15:20.147
<b>If that's not possible, then...</b>

15:20.937 --> 15:22.427
<b>As you command.</b>

15:28.817 --> 15:33.827
<b>So these are the Accursed Lands and the 
Cursed Sea of Trees that bars all life?</b>

15:34.907 --> 15:35.777
<b>Let's go.</b>

15:35.777 --> 15:36.797
<b>Yes.</b>

15:42.797 --> 15:43.507
<b>Stop!</b>

15:44.447 --> 15:45.547
<b>Sir Verdel?</b>

15:54.347 --> 15:55.607
<b>A young girl?</b>

15:58.907 --> 16:00.677
<b>Stop right there, girl!</b>

16:01.767 --> 16:03.217
<b>Who are you?!</b>

16:03.217 --> 16:04.987
<b>What are you doing in these Accursed Lands?!</b>

16:06.787 --> 16:10.847
<b>I'm a Dark Elf who fled into 
these woods to survive.</b>

16:10.847 --> 16:14.387
<b>I see that you are a Paladin of Qualia.</b>

16:14.387 --> 16:17.127
<b>What business has brought you here this day?</b>

16:17.397 --> 16:19.277
<b>I cannot tell you our reason.</b>

16:19.277 --> 16:22.387
<b>Answer our question first, little girl.</b>

16:22.387 --> 16:24.127
<b>What are you doing in these woods?</b>

16:24.777 --> 16:29.217
<b>I'm simply living alongside my brethren 
who faced similar circumstances.</b>

16:29.217 --> 16:32.867
<b>You've gone out of your way 
to live in such cursed land?</b>

16:32.867 --> 16:33.817
<b>Well, whatever.</b>

16:33.817 --> 16:35.927
<b>Our business is with this forest.</b>

16:35.927 --> 16:37.757
<b>You won't mind us entering, will you?</b>

16:37.757 --> 16:38.927
<b>You mustn't do that.</b>

16:38.927 --> 16:40.567
<b>I ask that you please refrain.</b>

16:43.857 --> 16:45.527
<b>We are men recognized by God—</b>

16:45.527 --> 16:47.537
<b>Be quiet, Lonius!</b>

16:47.537 --> 16:49.507
<b>I'm talking right now!</b>

16:49.507 --> 16:51.447
<b>M-My apologies.</b>

16:52.567 --> 16:54.977
<b><i>Did that really warrant such a rebuke?</i></b>

16:54.977 --> 16:58.077
<b><i>I simply interjected a little.</i></b>

16:58.447 --> 17:00.307
<b>We came here on a job.</b>

17:00.847 --> 17:04.547
<b>We can't exactly nod our heads and go 
home just because you don't like it.</b>

17:04.547 --> 17:06.557
<b>My brethren are terrified.</b>

17:06.557 --> 17:12.017
<b>We've all suffered a long and painful 
journey to finally find a place to live in peace.</b>

17:12.017 --> 17:14.807
<b>I ask that you please show us mercy.</b>

17:16.217 --> 17:17.517
<b>You're insistent on this.</b>

17:17.517 --> 17:19.147
<b>Is there something in the forest?</b>

17:19.147 --> 17:20.717
<b>There's nothing.</b>

17:20.717 --> 17:23.137
<b>Only peace and quiet.</b>

17:23.137 --> 17:25.317
<b>What about you, Sir Paladin?</b>

17:25.317 --> 17:29.237
<b>Why are you so intent 
on such a gloomy forest?</b>

17:38.287 --> 17:38.937
<b>Tsk!</b>

17:39.717 --> 17:43.957
<b>We've come due to a divine revelation 
of calamity lurking in this land!</b>

17:43.957 --> 17:46.717
<b>We can't return home without 
confirming the truth!</b>

17:49.137 --> 17:50.427
<b>Sir Verdel!</b>

17:50.427 --> 17:53.307
<b>The revelation is an 
important national secret!</b>

17:53.307 --> 17:54.287
<b>Why are you sharing it?!</b>

17:54.287 --> 17:56.157
<b>I told you to be quiet, didn't I?!</b>

17:56.157 --> 17:59.897
<b>Secret or not, there are times
 that things need to be said!</b>

18:01.907 --> 18:05.687
<b><i>Sharing a divine revelation without 
permission is a sinful breach of trust!</i></b>

18:05.687 --> 18:07.907
<b><i>Even if he is a High Paladin,</i></b>

18:07.907 --> 18:10.657
<b><i>there's still a limit to 
his personal authority!</i></b>

18:11.257 --> 18:15.267
<b>I'll be reporting this when 
we return to our homeland!</b>

18:15.267 --> 18:16.477
<b>Do as you please.</b>

18:17.247 --> 18:19.587
<b>A divine revelation, you say?</b>

18:20.087 --> 18:23.457
<b>So you Paladins are concerned about 
this potential calamity then?</b>

18:23.717 --> 18:24.787
<b>That's right.</b>

18:24.787 --> 18:27.547
<b>We'd like to enter this 
forest to confirm the truth.</b>

18:29.667 --> 18:31.637
<b>I'm terribly sorry.</b>

18:33.617 --> 18:34.957
<b><i>She's refusing?!</i></b>

18:34.957 --> 18:37.677
<b><i>After learning we're here on a 
revelation—a mission from God?!</i></b>

18:40.597 --> 18:44.757
<b>There's nothing for you to be concerned 
about in this land, Sir Paladin.</b>

18:44.757 --> 18:48.067
<b>I beg for your understanding and 
ask that you please go back.</b>

18:48.527 --> 18:51.327
<b>Just letting us in a 
little bit would be fine.</b>

18:51.327 --> 18:52.737
<b>Is that not possible either?</b>

18:53.337 --> 18:54.907
<b>I ask that you please refrain.</b>

18:55.897 --> 18:58.327
<b><i>Was that evil energy just now?</i></b>

18:58.327 --> 19:01.307
<b><i>Is this little girl really a Dark Elf?</i></b>

19:03.167 --> 19:05.257
<b><i>The revelation was correct!</i></b>

19:05.257 --> 19:07.167
<b><i>There is something in this forest!</i></b>

19:07.167 --> 19:08.427
<b><i>We have to find it!</i></b>

19:09.057 --> 19:11.037
<b>So there is no calamity then?</b>

19:11.037 --> 19:12.157
<b>There is not.</b>

19:13.377 --> 19:17.017
<b>And the chances of a calamity 
befalling us and our people?</b>

19:17.017 --> 19:18.767
<b>There's none.</b>

19:18.767 --> 19:21.477
<b>If anything, we are the ones to be afraid.</b>

19:21.987 --> 19:24.647
<b>Would you swear that before God?</b>

19:25.687 --> 19:28.107
<b>I swear it upon my god.</b>

19:35.087 --> 19:36.027
<b>We're leaving.</b>

19:37.517 --> 19:38.897
<b>What do you think you're doing?!</b>

19:38.897 --> 19:41.177
<b>She said they just want to live in peace.</b>

19:41.177 --> 19:43.197
<b>So there's no problem here.</b>

19:43.197 --> 19:45.247
<b>I can feel the evil energy coming from her!</b>

19:45.247 --> 19:48.087
<b>You would trust the word 
of someone like that?!</b>

19:48.087 --> 19:49.737
<b>Yeah, I would.</b>

19:49.737 --> 19:52.327
<b>Beginning from a place of trust 
is part of our doctrine!</b>

19:52.327 --> 19:54.087
<b>And if she's trying to deceive us?</b>

19:54.087 --> 19:58.057
<b>Don't let fear color your 
perspective, you impious man.</b>

19:58.367 --> 19:59.597
<b>There's no problem here.</b>

19:59.597 --> 20:01.517
<b>That's the result of our investigation.</b>

20:03.147 --> 20:04.557
<b>Now, let's get back home already.</b>

20:12.387 --> 20:13.577
<b>What a shame!</b>

20:13.577 --> 20:15.667
<b>High Paladin Verdel,</b>

20:15.667 --> 20:19.327
<b>I deem that you have abandoned our 
mission, and strip you of your authority!</b>

20:20.947 --> 20:21.977
<b>Huh?</b>

20:21.977 --> 20:23.407
<b>Are you screwing with me right now?</b>

20:23.407 --> 20:24.917
<b>You are the one screwing around!</b>

20:25.427 --> 20:28.087
<b>Not only have you shared the revelation,</b>

20:28.087 --> 20:30.127
<b>but you plan to return 
without investigating?!</b>

20:30.127 --> 20:32.257
<b>Are you making a mockery of God's will?!</b>

20:33.237 --> 20:36.467
<b>I cannot entrust this mission 
to someone like that!</b>

20:36.467 --> 20:39.177
<b>Henceforth, I shall be taking command!</b>

20:40.967 --> 20:43.907
<b>We will now enter the Accursed Lands 
and conduct our investigation!</b>

20:43.907 --> 20:46.517
<b>To ascertain the truth of this calamity!</b>

20:46.517 --> 20:47.687
<b>As you say, boss.</b>

20:47.687 --> 20:49.147
<b>Stop it! Bargo!</b>

20:49.687 --> 20:51.627
<b>I'm sorry, buddy.</b>

20:51.627 --> 20:55.107
<b>The one employing us is Sir Lonius.</b>

20:55.107 --> 20:56.567
<b>Dammit!</b>

20:57.017 --> 20:59.567
<b>I beg you, please don't be so rash.</b>

20:59.567 --> 21:01.657
<b>We're capable of talking this out.</b>

21:01.657 --> 21:02.867
<b>Silence!</b>

21:02.867 --> 21:05.217
<b>If you continue to interfere, 
then we won't show mercy!</b>

21:05.217 --> 21:05.787
<b>Seize her!</b>

21:05.787 --> 21:06.977
<b>Stop!</b>

21:06.977 --> 21:09.247
<b>Do not lay a hand on the defenseless!</b>

21:16.127 --> 21:18.177
<b>I guess it failed.</b>

21:26.267 --> 21:27.897
<b>Are you all right, Lonius?!</b>

21:28.977 --> 21:31.377
<b>Sir Verdel?</b>

21:47.517 --> 21:48.827
<b>What happened?</b>

21:48.827 --> 21:49.957
<b>It's a Witch!</b>

21:49.957 --> 21:51.337
<b>We found a damn Witch!</b>

21:53.837 --> 21:57.027
<b>And here everything was going so well, too.</b>

21:59.537 --> 22:03.237
<b>Life doesn't always go your way, does it?</b>
